|notes        = 
* ''Awakened Spirit's'' cooldown is affected by {{sti|ah|icononly=true}} {{as|ultimate haste|ah}}.
* ''Awakened'' ability casts are special cased to trigger {{iis|Experimental Hexplate}} {{nie|Overdrive}}, {{iis|Zeke's Convergence}} {{nie|Frostfire Tempest}}, and {{bi|Cloud Dragon Soul|possessive=true}} increased movement speed.
* The ''Awakened'' casts of ''{{ai|Wilding Claw|Udyr}}'' and ''{{ai|Wingborne Storm|Udyr}}'' are special cased to trigger {{iis|Malignance}} {{nie|Hatefog}} from their damage.
* {{ri|Axiom Arcanist}} will affect the ''Awakened'' cast of all abilities, but does not refund the cooldown of ''Awakened Spirit''.
** Only ''{{ais|Wilding Claw|Udyr}}'' lightning damage is amplified. The on-hit damage is not increased.{{bug|2}}
