** The bar has a '''<span style="color:white">white</span>''' color when ''Awakened Spirit'' is under 80% charge, a '''<span style="color:yellow">yellow</span>''' color when at 80% charge or above, and a '''<span style="color:red">red</span>''' color when an ''Awaken'' cast is available.
